3. Benefits of Cloud Monitoring and Alerts

✔ Proactive Issue Resolution – Identifies problems before they impact users.
✔ Improved Security – Detects and alerts about security threats in real time.
✔ Better Resource Utilization – Prevents over-provisioning and reduces cloud costs.
✔ High Availability – Ensures uptime by automatically scaling resources.
✔ Compliance & Auditing – Helps organizations meet regulatory requirements.


---

4. Best Practices for Cloud Monitoring & Alerts

✅ Set Up Meaningful Alerts – Avoid alert fatigue by prioritizing critical issues.
✅ Use Auto-Scaling & Self-Healing – Automate recovery actions for common failures.
✅ Monitor End-to-End Performance – Track infrastructure, applications, and user experience.
✅ Integrate with Incident Management Tools – Use platforms like PagerDuty for better response handling.
✅ Regularly Review & Optimize Alerts – Adjust thresholds to match evolving workloads.
